{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1000_017kth", "source_sha256": "41e473e01d4fb7a5e62012d2609a4e55c25bd900d10fd9d01a019d7e6c22f93f", "ja": "ううっ。やめた方がよかったかな……。\nやっぱり、いつもの方が……。で、でも……。", "zh": "呜呜。是不是不做比较好呢……\n果然还是和平时一样更好吧……可、可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9e223a8ad943781c497df6e25e6348f57ca0f3ccab4c59405403dd421657506e", "ja": "お疲れさま、琴葉。\n新しい衣装はどうかな？", "zh": "辛苦了，琴叶。\n新服装感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "689ad0bb6736545aba807898b71a9e89879063242edb5cc72f59840163863cd5", "ja": "えっ！？　あっ、{$P$}！\nお、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "咦！？啊，{$P$}！\n您、您好，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1003_p", "source_sha256": "46463e466880506a894a1e7f18a7fcdad46f6982eeaa45b197eb224ad5251871", "ja": "あっ、ごめん。\nもしかして、まだ確認中だったか？", "zh": "啊，抱歉。\n难道你还在确认中吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "0af626196f9020b4f279048e87836507d9c7e7627293c4b99aa65cd63cf45431", "ja": "い、いえ。確認はもう終わってて……。\nただ、その……心の準備ができてなかったというか。", "zh": "没、没有。我已经确认完了……\n只是，那个……我还没做好心理准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "ff26715186b4fa3ac23c18b40eff469fe929efbd66abf5d20723ca5e12149f0e", "ja": "新しい衣装をいただいたので、髪型も普段と違う風に\nしてみたんですけど……。どうですか？", "zh": "因为拿到了新服装，所以我也试着换了个和平时不一样的发型……您觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1ebbd9809f79079bcdec47ff3670b6ec36e6ce3f5da54f53b64b4840950c15c6", "ja": "ああ。新鮮な雰囲気で、よく似合ってるよ。\nその髪型は、琴葉が自分で考えたのか？", "zh": "啊。感觉很新鲜，很适合你。\n这个发型是琴叶自己想的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "4c6648036d8dc9e1d61155fef8712f7e8ad169bf2da42aeb89078a16f2ebfd1c", "ja": "は、はい……！\nこの衣装、アイスをモチーフにしてるんですよね？", "zh": "是、是的……！\n这套服装是以冰淇淋为主题的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "f9191d0258fb4f9cad4b1aab331d6f8d43ff18f29068cf381c88e1e19aab7e6c", "ja": "だから、私自身も何か涼しさを表現できたら、\nもっと素敵になるんじゃないかと思ったんです。", "zh": "所以我觉得，要是我自己也能表现出一丝清凉感，应该会变得更加出色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1009_p", "source_sha256": "90d7590c918891e48e1e700cd233c7afd2aad40973b4b3332a190e436e5b37be", "ja": "それで髪を束ねたのか。\nうん、衣装にピッタリだな！", "zh": "所以你才把头发扎起来啊。\n嗯，和服装非常搭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "2deed6312e315427a2a07f606f29bcc059a2e1dff963fad999ae72378c9cafec", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　{$P$}に\nそう言ってもらえて、安心しました。", "zh": "谢谢！能听到{$P$}这么说，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "f2a5bab81244c7dde0ce94f568488d1333176da90df3debfb1c95a82241bdc81", "ja": "でも……もう少し落ち着かないとダメですね。\nせっかくのモチーフなのに、照れてばかりで……。", "zh": "不过……还是得再冷静一点才行呢。\n难得有这么棒的主题，却一直害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "ee70c1f119c50c595809355dd6835459195ac1e144daf52a26741ce63765038d", "ja": "恥ずかしいなんて、冷たさとは真逆の感情ですから。\nしっかりしないと……！", "zh": "害羞这种情绪，和冰冷可是完全相反的。\n我得振作一点才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cd9f3d93cebfbef1d93195a4bee8fb9ec247b6a33478d942e42f388612b4cc14", "ja": "それはそれでいいんじゃないか？\nアイスの魅力は、冷たいだけじゃないしな。", "zh": "这样也挺好的吧？\n冰淇淋的魅力，可不只是冰凉而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "f50ec91a3ed30853ef8682dec0e024c70f3e70918afd843936c9b80fb9db3247", "ja": "た、確かに……。\n見た目やフレーバーの豊富さも、魅力のひとつです。", "zh": "确、确实……  \n丰富多彩的外观和口味，也是冰淇淋的魅力之一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "f217c22b3454ed4aa70b48af20b5c586c76ebb591acd2f9cab2456c52350bdd5", "ja": "頬が緩んでしまうような甘さも、そうですね。\n甘い魅力と言ったら……かわいさ、でしょうか？", "zh": "甜得让人不禁嘴角上扬的味道，也是呢。\n说到甜蜜的魅力……是可爱吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1016_p", "source_sha256": "05b165b95ef536156e54b0bd2899bd3a4256c0bca8fac30499516faad0bd1468", "ja": "かわいさか……。\nそれなら、琴葉はマスターしてるから問題ないな！", "zh": "可爱吗……。  \n那样的话，琴叶已经掌握了，所以没问题了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "b215dfd77457344263cf9d77b0f1a23e5466d80ea3a52719de627d9b4870279b", "ja": "ええっ！？\n{$P$}、それってどういう……。", "zh": "欸！？\n{$P$}，您这是什么意思……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5541d4ffd24811d202e1b1ac19f845c1be70108bf3e411b0d358824a4410e06f", "ja": "ん？　そのままの意味だよ。\n琴葉は、かわいいなと……。", "zh": "嗯？就是字面意思啊。\n我觉得琴叶很可爱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "8421d534209f73516551eb71e883dc093423c45fa042cfe2ecb8690479c0e9ad", "ja": "い、言わなくていいです、{$P$}！\nもう……。あまりからかわないでください。", "zh": "不、不用说出来了，{$P$}！\n真是的……请不要老是捉弄我啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "434829da9d6d291e4dff33ed49f3ae24e73b1c8a058b5ab403e0f4b4c2362269", "ja": "と、とにかく。冷たさやかわ……甘さも含めて、\nみんなを夢中にさせようと思います！", "zh": "总、总之。不管是冷酷感还是可……甜美感，我都想让大家为之着迷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0324_1021_p", "source_sha256": "906ad0aafa264c2c11bbb5e597a8ea1e08af4ce4b18e00ae03f1ccf2a3bcdf1d", "ja": "ああ、その意気だ！\n今の琴葉なら、かわいさを存分に引き出せるはずだ！", "zh": "啊，就是这种气势！\n现在的琴叶，一定能将可爱充分展现出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
